Modifications
-------------

This fork has been modified from the upstream project, including renaming of
the distributed packages to the `driftproxy` family. Changes are tracked in the
version control history of this repository, which is the "relevant date"
required by AGPL-3.0 section 5(a).

Compatibility note
------------------

The `$scramjet$`-prefixed globals, `scramjet-` DOM attribute names, and the
`scramjet.js` build artifact filenames are retained as an internal interface
between the JavaScript client, the WebAssembly rewriter, and downstream
integrators that configure `globals` explicitly. They are historical names and
do not indicate affiliation with the upstream project.

